/-!
# The full second resonance has a positive axial repair

The actual forcing coefficients are stored as an integer numerator and positive denominator.
Its sign is certified by outward integer coefficient bounds and a small rational endpoint
comparison. These bounds verify the original polynomial; they do not replace its coefficients.
The finite radial source attachment remains the independent FLINT recurrence receipt.
-/

noncomputable section

